<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO/v0.12> .
