<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#isPartOfLocation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "isPartOfLocation is used to ensure the LFTDO can accurately pinpoint anomalies, locations are modeled using a hierarchical \"Part-Whole\" relationship. This allows for spatial containment reasoning, where sub-locations (e.g., Kraal001) are logically nested within the parent Farm001." .
