<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#isTriggeredBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Event(s) such as SystemEvent or LivestockEvent or LivestockIndicator are triggered by BehaviourState. \n\nA LivestockEvent is usually triggered by exactly one method. However, a SystemEvent (like a \"System Overload\") might be triggered by many detection methods running at once. An event could also have zero detection methods if it was triggered manually by a human (Farmer)." .
