<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#Livestock> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Livestock are domestic animals such as cattle, sheep, and goats for labor, and the production of commodities for humans such as meat, milk, wool, and leather (Britannica, 2020).\n\nRelationships:\n1.Livestock is fitted with some end device for tracking and monitoring.\n2.Livestock has some body condition score.\n3.Livestock exhibit some Behaviour \n4.Livestock is located at some Farm Location" .
