<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#LivestockEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LivestockEvent  is the \"Outcome\" or \"Alert\" of the Livestock Indicators." .
<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#LivestockEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LivestockEvent" .
# 
# https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#LivestockIndicator
<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#LivestockIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#LivestockIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "LivestockIndicators satisfy the necessary and sufficient conditions to infer a different high-level LivestockEvent (e.g., TheftEvent), providing a clear audit trail from raw data to actionable alert." .
<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#LivestockIndicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LivestockIndicator" .
