<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#Participant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A participant in livestock farming such as Farmers, and others such as extended officers, veterinarians, and Law enforcement agents.\nA Farmer owns various domestic animals such as cattle, sheep, and goats. \nThe veterinarian understands the behavior of domestic animals and often treats the domestic animals for diseases.    \nExtended officers, work on a farm, to manage livestock such as feeding, keeping count, managing their well-being, and protecting against theft.\nLaw enforcement agents, enforce the law of the country if not being adhered to such as theft, and abuse of livestock.\n\nSub-classes:\n1. Farmer\n2.ExtendedOfficer\n3.LawEnforcementAgency\n4.Veterinarian" .
<https://github.com/tumelomodise/LFTDO#Participant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Participant" .
